Cell["\<\
Honest parent sets contain at most one prior-round block per authority. \
Equivocations remain visible but cannot inflate parent or decision thresholds.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"55f949f1-34ca-5548-8daf-348100106005"]
}, Open  ]],

