Cell["\<\
SafetyEnvelopePlot uses explicit {CommitteeSize, HonestIntersection} pairs \
grouped by Byzantine count. The frontier is only the uncalibrated synthetic \
sensitivity model.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c94a89d0-a376-b741-b0ed-70cd0cc4e740"]
}, Open  ]],

