Cell["\<\
The plot imports data/paper_production_benchmark.csv. Checks compare expected \
fields and latency ratios to that imported transcription. This is \
fixture/transcription consistency, not independent paper verification.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2eff9140-ecbe-1044-a82c-6768bf8edcdc"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["10. Executable fixture checks", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"a78d814d-7a12-d54a-a291-cfe58f43965a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["RunValidationSuite[]", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[20]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c618cb3e-c52b-a841-ae74-f6c55a4d2239"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"Passed\"\>", "\[Rule]", "12"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"Failed\"\>", "\[Rule]", "0"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"AllPassed\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"Checks\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\<\"FullSupportAndCertificatesCommit\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}],
       ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"FewerThanQCertificateAuthoritiesUndecided\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
       "True"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"QMinusOneSupportAuthoritiesUndecided\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
       "True"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"QNonSupportAuthoritiesSkip\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"DuplicateAuthorEquivocationDoesNotIncreaseCount\"\>", "\[Rule]",
        "True"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"SupportedProposalDeterministicallySelectsOne\"\>", "\[Rule]",
        "True"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"DeterministicReplay\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"ParentReferencesExist\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"DistinctParentAuthorities\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"CSVFixtureTranscriptionConsistency\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
       "True"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"CSVFixtureRatioConsistency\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\<\"SyntheticSampleFloor\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}]}], 
     "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"Scope\"\>", 
    "\[Rule]", "\<\"Educational equal-authority fixtures and CSV \
transcription consistency; not independent paper verification or complete \
protocol/Lean proof.\"\>"}]}], "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9946574528910007`*^9, 3.9946577840309258`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[20]=",ExpressionUUID->"466fba11-e3ba-cb45-aae8-46a1b75e2426"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Fixtures cover full support plus q certificates -> Commit; fewer than q \
certificate authorities -> Undecided; q-1 supporters -> Undecided; q \
non-support authorities -> Skip; duplicate-author equivocation; deterministic \
single-valued support; deterministic replay; parent existence and \
distinct-parent authorities; CSV rows/ratios; and the synthetic sample floor.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fed06538-55ed-424d-9fe5-775133f0ef9d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["11. Verification scope and limitations", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"cb108f44-eb5a-cd46-8504-b8a1998cf2d6"],

Cell["\<\
The companion Lean 4 project kernel-checks quorum intersection, honest \
overlap, same-slot certificate uniqueness, and the conflicting-transaction \
quorum core. Run build_all.ps1 for the combined release gate. Lean does not \
verify this Wolfram implementation or the complete protocol. Limitations \
include equal voting power rather than stake, deterministic parent selection, \
round-level observations, no full Mysticeti state machine, no indirect \
decision path, no epoch/GC/synchronization/cryptography model, and no \
complete safety or liveness theorem.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"457e5eb9-0ffe-c848-9f93-63c831888b88"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["12. KEY FINDINGS", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f8947e4d-5d25-974a-b0ad-4edb8ef7b03d"],

Cell["\<\
KEY FINDINGS
- Direct commit requires q distinct r+2 certificate authorities, and each \
certificate requires q distinct r+1 supporter authorities for one proposal.
- Direct skip evidence is counted at r+1.
- Deterministic support chooses at most one proposal per block and explicit \
slot.
- Equivocations are inspectable but never duplicate authority weight.
- Lean kernel-checks the equal-authority quorum core independently of Wolfram.
- Timing outputs are a seeded, uncalibrated synthetic sensitivity model with \
three message delays.
- CSV checks establish transcription consistency only; complete protocol \
correctness remains outside scope.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"530c1eae-122d-c848-9879-f79e25514499"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
},
